#. front matter: title
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:2
msgid "Aterm WG2600HP3にOpenWrtをインストールする"
msgstr "Install OpenWrt on an Aterm WG2600HP3"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:11
msgid "NECのAterm WG2600HP3にOpenWrtをインストールする方法について説明します。"
msgstr ""
"This article explains how to install OpenWrt on an NEC Aterm WG2600HP3."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:13
msgid "ハードウェア情報"
msgstr "Hardware Information"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:15
msgid "![Aterm WG2600HP3](images/aterm-wg2600hp3.webp)"
msgstr "![Aterm WG2600HP3](images/aterm-wg2600hp3.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:17
msgid ""
"| メーカー           | NEC                           |\n"
"| ------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n"
"| モデル             | Aterm WG2600HP3               |\n"
"| CPU                | Qualcomm Atheros IPQ8062 1GHz |\n"
"| フラッシュ         | 32MB                          |\n"
"| メモリ             | 512MB                         |\n"
"| イーサネットポート | 1Gbps×5                      |\n"
"| 無線LAN            | 2.4GHz: b/g/n, 5GHz: a/n/ac   |"
msgstr ""
"| Manufacturer | NEC |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| Model | Aterm WG2600HP3 |\n"
"| CPU | Qualcomm Atheros IPQ8062 1GHz |\n"
"| Flash | 32MB |\n"
"| Memory | 512MB |\n"
"| Ethernet ports | 5 x 1Gbps |\n"
"| Wireless LAN | 2.4GHz: b/g/n, 5GHz: a/n/ac |"

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:26
msgid "イメージのダウンロード"
msgstr "Download the Images"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:28
msgid ""
"今回はOpenWrt 24.10.0をインストールします。[OpenWrtの公式ダウンロードページ]"
"(https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/24.10.0/targets/ipq806x/generic/)か"
"ら、initramfsイメージとsysupgradeイメージをダウンロードしましょう。"
msgstr ""
"This example installs OpenWrt 24.10.0. Download the initramfs and sysupgrade "
"images from the [official OpenWrt download page](https://downloads.openwrt."
"org/releases/24.10.0/targets/ipq806x/generic/)."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:30
msgid ""
"nec_wg2600hp3-initramfs-uImage  \n"
"initramfsイメージ。"
msgstr ""
"`nec_wg2600hp3-initramfs-uImage`  \n"
"initramfs image."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:32
msgid ""
"nec_wg2600hp3-squashfs-sysupgrade.bin  \n"
"sysupgradeイメージ。"
msgstr ""
"`nec_wg2600hp3-squashfs-sysupgrade.bin`  \n"
"sysupgrade image."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:35
msgid "TFTPサーバーのセットアップ"
msgstr "Set Up a TFTP Server"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:37
msgid ""
"initramfsイメージの書き込みはTFTP経由で行われるため、TFTPサーバーをセットアッ"
"プする必要があります。"
msgstr ""
"The initramfs image is written over TFTP, so a TFTP server must be set up."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:39
msgid ""
"今回はWindowsがインストールされたPCと、Windows向けのTFTPサーバーソフトウェア"
"であるTftpd64を使用して、TFTPサーバーを構築します。"
msgstr ""
"In this example, a Windows PC and Tftpd64, a TFTP server application for "
"Windows, are used to build the TFTP server."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:41
msgid ""
"まずは、TFTPサーバーとなるPCのIPアドレスを`192.168.1.2/24`に設定しましょう。"
msgstr "Set the IP address of the TFTP server PC to `192.168.1.2/24`."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:43
msgid ""
"そして、TFTPで公開する適当なディレクトリを作成し、そこにinitramfsイメージを配"
"置します。"
msgstr ""
"Create a directory to publish over TFTP and place the initramfs image in it."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:45
msgid ""
"最後にTftpd64でTFTPサーバーを立ち上げてinitramfsイメージを公開します。Tftpd64"
"の詳細なセットアップ方法は以下を参考にしてください。"
msgstr ""
"Finally, start the TFTP server in Tftpd64 and publish the initramfs image. "
"See the following article for details."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:47
msgid ""
"[WindowsでTftpd64を使用してTFTPサーバーを立てる](/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-"
"windows-using-tftpd64)"
msgstr ""
"[Set Up a TFTP Server on Windows Using Tftpd64](/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-"
"windows-using-tftpd64)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:49
msgid "これでTFTPサーバーのセットアップは完了です。"
msgstr "The TFTP server setup is complete."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:51
msgid "シリアルコンソールに接続する"
msgstr "Connect to the Serial Console"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:53
msgid "Aterm WG2600HP3からUARTを引き出してシリアルコンソールに接続します。"
msgstr ""
"Connect to the serial console by exposing the UART pins on the Aterm "
"WG2600HP3."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:55
msgid "![Aterm WG2600HP3 UARTの端子](images/aterm-wg2600hp3-uart.webp)"
msgstr "![Aterm WG2600HP3 UART pins](images/aterm-wg2600hp3-uart.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:57
msgid ""
"J3がUARTの端子です。左端からVCC(3.3V)、2番目がGND、4番目がTX、5番目がRXです。"
"USB-TTLシリアル変換ケーブル等を用いてPCと接続しましょう。"
msgstr ""
"J3 is the UART connector. From the left, the pins are VCC (3.3V), GND on the "
"second pin, TX on the fourth pin, and RX on the fifth pin. Connect the "
"router to the PC using a USB-TTL serial converter cable or similar device."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:59
msgid ""
"| 項目           | 設定      |\n"
"| -------------- | --------- |\n"
"| ボーレート     | 115200bps |\n"
"| データビット   | 8bit      |\n"
"| パリティビット | none      |\n"
"| ストップビット | 1bit      |\n"
"| フロー制御     | none      |"
msgstr ""
"| Item | Setting |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| Baud rate | 115200bps |\n"
"| Data bits | 8bit |\n"
"| Parity bits | none |\n"
"| Stop bits | 1bit |\n"
"| Flow control | none |"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:67
msgid ""
"Aterm WG2600HP3の電源を入れ、u-bootの出力が出たところでEscキーを押下すると、"
"コンソールのログイン画面が表示されます。パスワードに`chiron`と入力してログイ"
"ンしましょう。"
msgstr ""
"Turn on the Aterm WG2600HP3 and press Esc when the u-boot output appears. "
"The console login screen is displayed. Log in with `chiron` as the password."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:69
msgid "これで、シリアルコンソールの接続は完了です。"
msgstr "The serial console connection is now complete."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:71
msgid "initramfsイメージのインストール"
msgstr "Install the initramfs Image"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:73
msgid ""
"TFTPサーバーとAterm WG2600HP3をLANケーブルで接続しましょう。Aterm WG2600HP3の"
"LANポートはLAN1からLAN4のどれでも構いません。"
msgstr ""
"Connect the TFTP server and the Aterm WG2600HP3 with a LAN cable. Any LAN "
"port from LAN1 through LAN4 can be used."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:75
msgid ""
"接続後、シリアルで以下のコマンドを実行して、initramfsイメージをインストールし"
"ます。"
msgstr ""
"After connecting them, run the following commands over the serial connection "
"to install the initramfs image."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:104
msgid ""
"これによりTFTPサーバーからinitramfsイメージがインストールされ、OpenWrtが起動"
"します。しばらく待った後Enterキーを押下しましょう。"
msgstr ""
"The initramfs image is installed from the TFTP server and OpenWrt boots. "
"Wait a while, then press Enter."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:125
msgid "このような表示が出たらinitramfsイメージのインストールは完了です。"
msgstr ""
"When this screen is displayed, the initramfs image installation is complete."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:127
msgid "メーカーファームのバックアップ"
msgstr "Back Up the Manufacturer Firmware"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:129
msgid ""
"将来的にメーカーファームに戻す可能性がある場合は、sysupgradeイメージを書き込"
"む前にバックアップを取りましょう。"
msgstr ""
"If you may want to return to the manufacturer firmware in the future, create "
"a backup before writing the sysupgrade image."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:131
msgid "まずは、OpenWrtでフラッシュの中身を確認をします。"
msgstr "First, check the flash contents in OpenWrt."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:156
msgid ""
"firmwareパーティションにメーカーファームが配置されています。デバイスを確認し"
"てddコマンドでバックアップを取りましょう。"
msgstr ""
"The manufacturer firmware is stored in the firmware partition. Check the "
"device and back it up with `dd`."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:162
msgid ""
"バックアップを取った後は、PCでscpコマンドを使ってメーカーファームを取得しま"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"After creating the backup, retrieve the manufacturer firmware on the PC with "
"`scp`."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:168
msgid "これでメーカーファームのバックアップは完了です。大切に保管しましょう。"
msgstr "The manufacturer firmware backup is complete. Store it carefully."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:170
msgid "sysupgradeイメージのインストール"
msgstr "Install the sysupgrade Image"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:172
msgid ""
"scpコマンドを使用して、PCからAterm WG2600HP3にsysupgradeイメージを転送しま"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"Transfer the sysupgrade image from the PC to the Aterm WG2600HP3 with `scp`."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:178
msgid ""
"転送後、Aterm WG2600HP3でsysupgradeコマンドを使用して、sysupgradeイメージを書"
"き込みましょう。"
msgstr ""
"After transferring it, write the sysupgrade image on the Aterm WG2600HP3 "
"with `sysupgrade`."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:184
msgid ""
"これによりsysupgradeイメージのインストールが開始されます。インストールが完了"
"し、再起動されるまでしばらく待ちましょう。"
msgstr ""
"The sysupgrade image installation starts. Wait for the installation and "
"reboot to complete."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:186
msgid "再起動後、OpenWrtが起動します。これでOpenWrtのインストールは完了です。"
msgstr "OpenWrt boots after the reboot. The OpenWrt installation is complete."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:188
msgid "メーカーファームに戻す"
msgstr "Return to the Manufacturer Firmware"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:190
msgid ""
"事前にメーカーファームのバックアップを取っていた場合、OpenWrtからメーカー"
"ファームに戻すことができます。ここでは、その方法について説明します。"
msgstr ""
"If you created a backup of the manufacturer firmware, you can return to it "
"from OpenWrt."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:192
msgid ""
"まずは、scpコマンドを使用して、バックアップしておいたメーカーファームをPCから"
"Aterm WG2600HP3に転送します。"
msgstr ""
"First, transfer the backed-up manufacturer firmware from the PC to the Aterm "
"WG2600HP3 with `scp`."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:198
msgid ""
"転送が完了したらOpenWrtでmtdコマンドを使用して、フラッシュにメーカーファーム"
"を書き込みましょう。ファームウェアはfirmwareパーティションに書き込みます。"
msgstr ""
"After the transfer completes, write the manufacturer firmware to the flash "
"with the `mtd` command. Write it to the firmware partition."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/install-openwrt-on-aterm-wg2600hp3/index.md:204
msgid ""
"書き込み完了後はAterm WG2600HP3を再起動しましょう。再起動後、メーカーファーム"
"で起動されます。"
msgstr ""
"After writing is complete, restart the Aterm WG2600HP3. It boots with the "
"manufacturer firmware after restarting."
